<title>UK: N.Sea Nelson output hit by gas problem - source.</title>
<headline>N.Sea Nelson output hit by gas problem - source.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-07-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>Output at the North Sea's Nelson field has fallen by about 20,000 barrels per day (bpd) to 120,000 bpd due to problems with gas lift secondary recovery, a source at the operator said on Thursday.</p>
<p>The source at operator Enterprise Oil said output could fall further to about 50,000 barrels per day over the coming week because of the technical problem.</p>
</text>
